    "sections": {
        "description": "Personal Tutor is a thoughtfully structured theme created for independent tutors, subject mentors, and small coaching centers who need a focused academic website. Instead of overloaded layouts, it emphasizes clarity with well-defined sections for courses, tutor profiles, schedules, and student feedback. The theme is suitable for private tuition services, online classes, and skill-based training programs. Built as a lightweight education theme, Personal Tutor includes clean typography, structured content blocks, customizable header and footer options, and flexible layout settings. It supports essential features, integrates smoothly with popular page builders, and follows SEO-friendly coding practices. Designed for tutoring websites and learning platforms, this responsive theme ensures content remains readable across devices while maintaining fast loading performance and a straightforward user experience."
    },
